    "heading": "Software"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:109",
    "text": "The Studio 5000® development environment helps you respond quickly to changes in market and business needs and reduces total costs of ownership. New design capabilities can increase automation productivity and reduce costs during a project’s lifecycle. Studio 5000 extends beyond one controller to be a system-wide development and design tool.",
    "heading": "Software"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:110",
